    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῑτίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιππίζω</span>
			, <i>cry 'ti, ti', cheep</i>
			like a young bird; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιτίζοντας</span> was the reading of <i><span class="en">
				Zenod.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετριγῶτας</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.314
			</span></i>. (Onomatop.)</div>
